    "enUS": {
      "description": "Ho, {name}.  I heard that Ragnar Thunderbrew is steaming mad about someone stealing his ale.  He's looking for stalwart adventurers, and willing to pay plenty.\n\nTalk to Ragnar if you're interested.  He's at the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos, in Dun Morogh.",
      "summary": "Speak with Ragnar Thunderbrew.",
      "title": "Ragnar Thunderbrew",
